#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kappname; game screen</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kappname; ekran igre</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "The top of the playing area is occupied by the menubar and toolbar."
msgstr "Vrh prostora za igru zauzimaju meni i alatna traka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "The central part of the &kappname; screen is the playing area."
msgstr "Centralni dio &kappname; ekrana je područje igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the left and on the right sides of the playing area there are the Red "
"Player's and the Blue Player's information screens."
msgstr ""
"Na lijevoj i na desnoj strani prostora za igru postoje ekrani za informacije "
"o Crvenom Igraču i Plavom Igraču."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The top box on the information screen represents the <quote>Hit Points</"
"quote> of the spacecraft."
msgstr ""
"Kutija na vrhu ekranu sa informacijama predstavlja <quote>Životne bodove</"
"quote> letjelice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "The middle box on the information screen represents the battery power."
msgstr "Srednja kutija na ekranu sa informacijama predstavlja snagu baterije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "The bottom box on the information screen shows player's number of wins."
msgstr "Kutija na dnu ekrana sa informacijama pokazuje broj pobjeda igrača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "The bottom of the playing area is the status bar."
msgstr "Na dnu prostora za igru je status bar."

