"sections about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings"
"\">Settings Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus."
"html#menus-help\">Help Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Pored toga &kspaceduel; ima zajedničku &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> stavke izbornika, za više informacija pročitajte "
"sekcije o <ulink url =\"Pomoć: /fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Meni "
"postavki</ulink> i <ulink url =\"Pomoć: /fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\"> "
"Pomoć Meni </ulink> od &kde; osnove."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljena pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim da promijenim izgled igre. Mogu li ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. At this moment &kappname; features only one theme."
msgstr "Ne. U ovom trenutku &kappname; imamo samo jednu temu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr "Napravio sam grešku. Mogu li poništiti?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; does not have an <quote>Undo</quote> feature."
msgstr "Ne. &kappname; nema <quote>Poništi </quote> postavku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr "Ne mogu da shvatim šta da radim ovdje! Da li postoje nagovještaji?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No. &kappname; does not have a <quote>Hint</quote> feature. However, if you "
"carefully read through the <link linkend=\"rules_and_tips\">Game Rules, "
"Strategies and Tips</link> section you shouldn't have this problem."
msgstr ""
"Ne. &kappname;  nema <quote>Nagovještaj</quote> funkciju. Međutim, ako ste "
"pažljivo pročitali <link linkend=\"rules_and_tips\">Pravila igre, strategije "
"i savjeti</link>poglavlje ne biste trebali imati ovaj problem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"Moram da napustim igru, ali još nisam završio. Da li mogu da snimim napredak?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; does not have a <quote>Save</quote> feature."
msgstr "Ne. &kappname; nema <quote>Spasi</quote> postavku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:254 index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija igre"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Keys"
msgstr "Ključevi igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; has a default set of keys to control the game. For a list of "
"default keys see the section entitled <link linkend=\"keys\">Default "
"Shortcuts</link>."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; ima podrazumijevane ključeve za kontrolu igre. Za listu "
"podrazumijevanih tipki pogledajte odjeljak pod naslovom<link linkend=\"keys"
"\">Podrazumijevane prečice</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keys can be configured by selecting <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from "
"the menubar."
msgstr ""
"Ključevi mogu biti konfigurisani selektovanjem <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši postavke...</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> iz izbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will bring up a dialog box which lets you configure all hotkeys, "
"including the keys used for steering the space ships, for firing bullets, "
"and for laying mines."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će prikazati dijalog koji vam omogućava konfiguriranje svih vrućih "
"ključeva, uključujući tipke korištene za upravljanje svemirskim brodovima, "
"za ispaljivanje metaka, kao i za polaganje mina."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can see that each player (Red and Blue), has 5 keystrokes corresponding "
"to Rotate Left, Rotate Right, Accelerate, Shot, and Mines."
msgstr ""
"Možete vidjeti da svaki igrač (Crveni i Plavi), ima 5 tipke odgovara kojima "
"odgovara Rotiraj lijevo, Rotiraj desno, Ubrzaj, Pucaj i Mine."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are finished configuring your keys, you should click on "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> to apply your changes."
msgstr ""
"Kada završite konfiguriranje svojih ključeva, trebate kliknuti na "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> da primijenite promjene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to restore the default keys, simply click on the "
"<guibutton>Default</guibutton> button once. To make these changes permanent, "
"press <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da vratite podrazumijevane ključeve, jednostavno kliknite na "
"<guibutton>Podrazumijevano</guibutton> dugme jednom. Da učinite ove pomjene "
"stalne, kliknite<guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to abandon the changes you made, and return to your previously "
"selected keys, simply click <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>, and your changes "
"will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da odustane od promjena koje ste napravili, i vratiti se "
"prethodno odabranim ključevima, jednostavno kliknite <guibutton>Poništi</"
"guibutton>, i vaše promjene će biti izgubljene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "All game settings of &kappname; are configurable."
msgstr "Sve postavke igre od &kappname; su podesive."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to change the game settings, simply select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite promijeniti postavke igre, jednostavno selektujte "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kappname;..."
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice>iz izbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will bring up a dialog box with two pages, labelled <guilabel>General</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Game</guilabel>. The first page is rather simple, "
"the second one has seven tabs across the top."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će prikazati dijalog sa dvije stranice, označene <guilabel>Generalno</"
"guilabel> i <guilabel>Igra</guilabel>. Prva stranici je prilično "
"jednostavna, a druga ima sedam tabova na vrhu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Settings are collected in different configurations. You can choose from "
"several pre-defined configurations."
msgstr ""
"Postavke se prikupljaju u različitim konfiguracijama. Možete birati između "
"nekoliko unaprijed definiranih konfiguracija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose the <guilabel>Custom</guilabel> configuration, you can define "
"all settings for yourself."
msgstr ""
"Ako odaberete <guilabel>Prilagođeno</guilabel>konfiguraciju, možete "
"definisati sve postavke sami."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have not selected <guilabel>Custom</guilabel>, you will not be able "
"to make any changes to these options."
msgstr ""
"Ako niste odabrali <guilabel>Prilagođeno</guilabel>konfiguraciju, nećete "
"moći definisati sve postavke sami."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have found an interesting configuration, mail it to the author of the "
"game. It can be implemented in a future version (send the part [Game] in the "
"file <filename>~/.kde/share/config/kspaceduelrc</filename>)."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste pronašli zanimljivu konfiguracije, pošaljite mailom autoru igre. "
"Može biti implementiran u budućoj verziji (pošaljite dio [Igre] u "
"datoteci<filename>~/.kde/share/config/kspaceduelrc</filename>)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are finished altering the options, you should click on "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> to apply your changes."
msgstr ""
"Kada završite izmjenu opcija, trebate kliknuti na<guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"da primijenite vaše promjene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to restore the default, simply click on the <guibutton>Default</"
"guibutton> button once. To make these changes permanent, press "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da vratite podrazumijevane, jednostavno kliknite "
"na<guibutton>Podrazumijevano</guibutton> dugme jednom. Da učinite ove "
"promjene dugotrajnim, kliknite <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to abandon the changes you made, and return to your previous "
"options, simply click <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>, and your changes will "
"be lost."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite da odustane od promjena koje ste napravili i vratiti se na svoje "
"prethodne opcije, jednostavno kliknite<guibutton>Poništi</guibutton>, i vaše "
"promjene će biti izgubljene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "The settings are:"
msgstr "Postavke su:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "Općenito"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hit Points"
msgstr "Poeni pogodaka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These two sliders allow you to define the hitpoints for each of the two "
"players; you might want to decrease the hitpoints for a player to give that "
"player a handycap."
msgstr ""
"Ova dva klizače vam omogućavaju da definirate poene pogodaka za svaki od dva "
"igrača; možda želite da se smanji poeni pogodaka igraču da biste ga oslabili."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid "Refresh time"
msgstr "Vrijeme osvježavanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Time between two screen refreshes in milliseconds. All other settings are "
"independent of the refresh time."
msgstr ""
"Vrijeme između dva osvježavanja ekrana u milisekundi. Sve ostale postavke su "
"nezavisne od vremena osvježavanja."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Red Player</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Crveni igrač</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can define whether the red player gets controlled by the AI, and "
"also choose the skill level of the AI for this player. Just experiment with "
"the different skill level to find one which fits you."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odrediti da li se crveni igrač kontroliše pomoći AI, kao i "
"odabrati razinu vještina AI za ovog igrača. Samo eksperimentišite sa "
"različitim nivoima vještine kako biste pronašli onu koja vam odgovara."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Blue Player</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>plavi igrač</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This works the same as the options for the <guilabel>Red Player</guilabel> "
"described above."
msgstr ""
"Ovo funkcioniše isto kao opcije za  <guilabel>Crvenog igrača</guilabel> "
"opisane iznad."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game"
msgstr "Igra"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game speed"
msgstr "Brzina igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "Controls the speed of the whole game."
msgstr "Kontrolira brzinu cijele igre."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Bullet</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Metak</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shot speed"
msgstr "Brzina pucnjave"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "The speed of bullets"
msgstr "Brzina metaka"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:318 index.docbook:347 index.docbook:376 index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid "Energy need"
msgstr "Potrebna energija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "The amount of energy needed for one shot."
msgstr "Količina energije potrebna za jedan pucanj."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:322 index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "Max number"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid "The maximum number of bullets a player can have on the screen."
msgstr "Maksimalan broj metaka koje igrač može imati na ekranu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:326 index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "Damage"
msgstr "Šteta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid "The number of hit points damage done when a bullet hits a ship."
msgstr "Broj bodova štetnih udaraca radi kada metak pogodi brod."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:330 index.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid "Life time"
msgstr "Životni vijek"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "The maximum life time of a bullet."
msgstr "Maksimalan životni vijek metka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:334 index.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload time"
msgstr "Vrijeme ponovnog učitavanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "The time a ship needs to reload a bullet."
msgstr "Vrijeme potrebno brodu da ponovo učita metak."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Mine</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Mine</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mine fuel"
msgstr "Gorivo mine"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid "The amount of fuel on a mine."
msgstr "Količina goriva na mini."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "The amount of energy needed for laying a mine."
msgstr "Količina energije potrebna za postaganje mine."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid "Activate time"
msgstr "Vrijeme aktiviranja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid "The time a mine is inactive."
msgstr "Vrijeme koje je mina neaktivna."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid "The number of hit points of damage done when a ship hits a mine."
msgstr "Broj štetnih udaraca kada je brod udario u minu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum number of mines a player can have on the screen."
msgstr "Maksimalan broj mina koje igrač može imati na ekranu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid "The time a ship needs to reload a mine."
msgstr "Vrijeme potrebno brodu da ponovo učita minu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ship"
msgstr "Brod"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid "Acceleration"
msgstr "Ubrzanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid "Acceleration of the ships"
msgstr "Ubrzanje broda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid "The energy needed to accelerate a ship."
msgstr "Energija potrebna da se ubrza brod."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rotation speed"
msgstr "Brzina rotacije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid "The speed at which a ship rotates."
msgstr "Brzina pri kojoj brod rotira."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid "The energy needed to rotate a ship."
msgstr "Energija potrebna za rotiranje broda."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crash damage"
msgstr "Šteta sudara"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid "The number of hit points damage done when two ships collide."
msgstr "Broj štetnih bodova kada se sudara dva broda."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Sun</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Sunce</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sun energy"
msgstr "Sunčeva energija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The strength of the sun. The higher the value, the quicker ships will be "
"recharged."
msgstr "Jačina sunca. Što je veća vrijednost, brže će se brodovi napuniti."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:401
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gravity"
msgstr "Gravitacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid "The strength of the gravitational pull of the sun."
msgstr "Snaga gravitacije sunca."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:407
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Početak"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Position X</guilabel> and <guilabel>Position Y</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Pozicija X</guilabel>i <guilabel>Pozicija Y</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The ships position at the beginning of a new round. The ships start at "
"opposite sides of the sun."
msgstr ""
"Položaj brodova na početku nove runde. Brodovi ppočinju na suprotnim "
"stranama sunca."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Velocity X</guilabel> and <guilabel>Velocity Y</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Brzina X</guilabel> i <guilabel>Brzina Y</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid "Velocity at the beginning of a new round."
msgstr "Brzina na početku nove runde."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Powerups</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Povećanje energije</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid "Appearance time"
msgstr "Vrijeme pojave"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:424
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximal time between the appearance of two powerups."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme između pojave dva povećanja energije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximal life time of a powerup."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme povećanja energije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid "Energy amount"
msgstr "Količina energije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid "Amount of energy a player gets from an energy powerup."
msgstr "Količina energije koju igrač dobije od energije povećanja energije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shield amount"
msgstr "Iznos štita"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid "Amount of hit points a player gets from a shield powerup."
msgstr "Količina bodova pogodaka igrač dobije od štita povećanja energije."

